SUMMARY:Get ready: Presidential preference election in 120 days
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- Federal: Party presidential nominee (only for
  voters registered with a participating party) (expected\, not yet officia
 l)\nSee your exact ballot at https://my.arizona.vote\n\nYour checklist:\n
 ☐ Check that you're registered: https://my.arizona.vote\n☐ Moved? Upda
 te your address by February 21 (date expected)\n☐ Want to vote by mail? 
 Request an early ballot by March 10 (date expected)\, or join the Active E
 arly Voting List to get one every election: https://azsos.gov/elections/ab
 out-elections/county-election-contact-info\n☐ See who and what is on you
 r ballot: https://my.arizona.vote\n☐ Learn about the candidates and meas
 ures in the Clean Elections voter guide: https://www.azcleanelections.gov\
 n☐ Decide how and when you'll vote\n\nWant help? https://chatgpt.com/?q=
 Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20Arizona%20presidential%20preference%
 20election%20on%202028-03-21.%20I%20live%20in%20Arizona.\n\nFind your coun
 ty elections office: https://azsos.gov/elections/about-elections/county-el
 ection-contact-info\nCheck your registration: https://my.arizona.vote
URL:https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20Arizona%20
 presidential%20preference%20election%20on%202028-03-21.%20I%20live%20in%20
