  voters registered with a participating party) (expected\, not yet officia
 l)\nSee your exact ballot at https://my.arizona.vote\n\nPolls are open 6 a
 .m. to 7 p.m. If you're in line by 7 p.m.\, you can still vote.\nYour chec
 klist:\n☐ Find where to vote through your county elections: https://azso
 s.gov/elections/about-elections/county-election-contact-info\n☐ Voting i
 n person? Bring an ID\, like a driver's license or tribal ID\n☐ Still ha
 ve your early ballot? Drop it off at any voting location by 7 p.m.\n\nNeed
  a plan? https://chatgpt.com/?q=It%27s%20almost%20election%20day%20for%20t
 he%20Arizona%20presidential%20preference%20election.%20Help%20me%20finish%
 20my%20plan%20to%20vote.%20I%20live%20in%20Arizona.\n\nFind your county el
 ections office: https://azsos.gov/elections/about-elections/county-electio
 n-contact-info\nCheck your registration: https://my.arizona.vote
URL:https://azsos.gov/elections/about-elections/county-election-contact-inf
