DTSTAMP:20261123T042651Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280710
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20280711
SUMMARY:Get ready: 2028 general election in 120 days
DESCRIPTION:On the ballot:\n- School district: School board seats and any d
 istrict bond or override measures (expected\, not yet official)\n- County:
  County offices in every county (supervisors\, recorder\, sheriff\, county
  attorney\, assessor\, treasurer\, school superintendent)\n- State: All 90
  state legislature seats\n- State: Three Corporation Commission seats\n- S
 tate: Statewide ballot measures\, if any qualify (expected\, not yet offic
 ial)\n- Federal: President\n- Federal: U.S. Senate (the seat Mark Kelly ho
 lds)\n- Federal: All nine U.S. House seats\nSee your exact ballot at https
 ://my.arizona.vote\n\nYour checklist:\n☐ Check that you're registered: h
 ttps://my.arizona.vote\n☐ Moved? Update your address by October 9\n☐ W
 ant to vote by mail? Request an early ballot by October 27\, or join the A
 ctive Early Voting List to get one every election: https://azsos.gov/elect
 ions/about-elections/county-election-contact-info\n☐ See who and what is
  on your ballot: https://my.arizona.vote\n☐ Learn about the candidates a
 nd measures in the Clean Elections voter guide: https://www.azcleanelectio
 ns.gov\n☐ Decide how and when you'll vote\n\nWant help? https://chatgpt.
 com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20General%20election%20on%20202
 8-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Arizona.\n\nFind your county elections office: 
 https://azsos.gov/elections/about-elections/county-election-contact-info\n
 Check your registration: https://my.arizona.vote
URL:https://chatgpt.com/?q=Help%20me%20get%20ready%20for%20the%20General%20
 election%20on%202028-11-07.%20I%20live%20in%20Arizona.
